<Page
    x:Class="TextBoxDemo.Pages.ApplicationsPage"
    xmlns="http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml/presentation"
    xmlns:x="http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml"
    xmlns:d="http://schemas.microsoft.com/expression/blend/2008"
    xmlns:local="clr-namespace:TextBoxDemo.Pages"
    xmlns:mc="http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/markup-compatibility/2006"
    Title="应用场景示例"
    d:DesignHeight="450"
    d:DesignWidth="800"
    Background="Wheat"
    mc:Ignorable="d">

    <ScrollViewer>
        <StackPanel Margin="20">
            <TextBlock
                Margin="0,0,0,20"
                FontSize="24"
                FontWeight="Bold"
                Text="TextBox 应用场景示例" />

            <!--  介绍  -->
            <Border
                Margin="0,0,0,20"
                Padding="15"
                Background="#f9f9f9"
                BorderBrush="#ddd"
                BorderThickness="1">
                <StackPanel>
                    <TextBlock TextWrapping="Wrap">
                        本页面展示TextBox在实际应用中的几种常见场景，包括登录表单、搜索框、评论框和富文本编辑等。
                    </TextBlock>
                </StackPanel>
            </Border>

            <!--  登录表单  -->
            <TextBlock
                Margin="0,10"
                FontSize="18"
                FontWeight="Bold"
                Text="1. 登录表单" />
            <Border
                Width="350"
                Margin="0,10,0,20"
                Padding="20"
                HorizontalAlignment="Left"
                Background="White"
                BorderBrush="#ddd"
                BorderThickness="1">
                <StackPanel>
                    <TextBlock
                        Margin="0,0,0,15"
                        FontSize="16"
                        FontWeight="Bold"
                        Text="用户登录" />

                    <TextBlock Margin="0,0,0,5" Text="用户名:" />
                    <TextBox
                        x:Name="UsernameTextBox"
                        Margin="0,0,0,10"
                        Padding="8,5" />

                    <TextBlock Margin="0,0,0,5" Text="密码:" />
                    <PasswordBox
                        x:Name="PasswordBox"
                        Margin="0,0,0,15"
                        Padding="8,5" />

                    <CheckBox Margin="0,0,0,15" Content="记住我" />

                    <Button
                        Padding="15,5"
                        Background="#3498db"
                        BorderThickness="0"
                        Content="登录"
                        Foreground="White" />
                </StackPanel>
            </Border>

            <!--  搜索框  -->
            <TextBlock
                Margin="0,10"
                FontSize="18"
                FontWeight="Bold"
                Text="2. 搜索框" />
            <Grid
                Width="500"
                Margin="0,10,0,20"
                HorizontalAlignment="Left">
                <Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                    <ColumnDefinition Width="*" />
                    <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto" />
                </Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                <TextBox
                    x:Name="SearchBox"
                    Grid.Column="0"
                    Padding="8,5" />
                <Button
                    Grid.Column="1"
                    Padding="10,5"
                    Background="#3498db"
                    BorderThickness="0"
                    Content="搜索"
                    Foreground="White" />
            </Grid>

            <!--  评论框  -->
            <TextBlock
                Margin="0,10"
                FontSize="18"
                FontWeight="Bold"
                Text="3. 评论框" />
            <Border
                Width="500"
                Margin="0,10,0,20"
                Padding="15"
                HorizontalAlignment="Left"
                Background="White"
                BorderBrush="#ddd"
                BorderThickness="1">
                <StackPanel>
                    <TextBlock Margin="0,0,0,10" Text="发表评论" />
                    <TextBox
                        x:Name="CommentBox"
                        Height="100"
                        Margin="0,0,0,10"
                        Padding="8,5"
                        AcceptsReturn="True"
                        TextWrapping="Wrap" />
                    <StackPanel HorizontalAlignment="Right" Orientation="Horizontal">
                        <Button
                            Margin="0,0,10,0"
                            Padding="10,5"
                            Background="#bdc3c7"
                            BorderThickness="0"
                            Content="取消"
                            Foreground="White" />
                        <Button
                            Padding="10,5"
                            Background="#2ecc71"
                            BorderThickness="0"
                            Content="提交评论"
                            Foreground="White" />
                    </StackPanel>
                </StackPanel>
            </Border>

            <!--  地址输入表单  -->
            <TextBlock
                Margin="0,10"
                FontSize="18"
                FontWeight="Bold"
                Text="4. 地址输入表单" />
            <Border
                Width="500"
                Margin="0,10,0,20"
                Padding="15"
                HorizontalAlignment="Left"
                Background="White"
                BorderBrush="#ddd"
                BorderThickness="1">
                <Grid>
                    <Grid.RowDefinitions>
                        <RowDefinition Height="Auto" />
                        <RowDefinition Height="Auto" />
                        <RowDefinition Height="Auto" />
                        <RowDefinition Height="Auto" />
                        <RowDefinition Height="Auto" />
                        <RowDefinition Height="Auto" />
                    </Grid.RowDefinitions>
                    <Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                        <ColumnDefinition Width="100" />
                        <ColumnDefinition Width="*" />
                    </Grid.ColumnDefinitions>

                    <TextBlock
                        Grid.Row="0"
                        Grid.Column="0"
                        Margin="0,5"
                        VerticalAlignment="Center"
                        Text="收件人:" />
                    <TextBox
                        Grid.Row="0"
                        Grid.Column="1"
                        Margin="0,5"
                        Padding="5" />

                    <TextBlock
                        Grid.Row="1"
                        Grid.Column="0"
                        Margin="0,5"
                        VerticalAlignment="Center"
                        Text="手机号码:" />
                    <TextBox
                        Grid.Row="1"
                        Grid.Column="1"
                        Margin="0,5"
                        Padding="5" />

                    <TextBlock
                        Grid.Row="2"
                        Grid.Column="0"
                        Margin="0,5"
                        VerticalAlignment="Center"
                        Text="省/市/区:" />
                    <StackPanel
                        Grid.Row="2"
                        Grid.Column="1"
                        Margin="0,5"
                        Orientation="Horizontal">
                        <ComboBox
                            Width="100"
                            Margin="0,0,5,0"
                            SelectedIndex="0">
                            <ComboBoxItem Content="北京市" />
                            <ComboBoxItem Content="上海市" />
                            <ComboBoxItem Content="广东省" />
                        </ComboBox>
                        <ComboBox
                            Width="100"
                            Margin="0,0,5,0"
                            SelectedIndex="0">
                            <ComboBoxItem Content="北京市" />
                            <ComboBoxItem Content="上海市" />
                            <ComboBoxItem Content="广州市" />
                        </ComboBox>
                        <ComboBox Width="100" SelectedIndex="0">
                            <ComboBoxItem Content="朝阳区" />
                            <ComboBoxItem Content="海淀区" />
                            <ComboBoxItem Content="东城区" />
                        </ComboBox>
                    </StackPanel>

                    <TextBlock
                        Grid.Row="3"
                        Grid.Column="0"
                        Margin="0,5"
                        VerticalAlignment="Top"
                        Text="详细地址:" />
                    <TextBox
                        Grid.Row="3"
                        Grid.Column="1"
                        Height="60"
                        Margin="0,5"
                        Padding="5"
                        AcceptsReturn="True"
                        TextWrapping="Wrap" />

                    <TextBlock
                        Grid.Row="4"
                        Grid.Column="0"
                        Margin="0,5"
                        VerticalAlignment="Center"
                        Text="邮政编码:" />
                    <TextBox
                        Grid.Row="4"
                        Grid.Column="1"
                        Margin="0,5"
                        Padding="5" />

                    <Button
                        Grid.Row="5"
                        Grid.Column="1"
                        Margin="0,10,0,0"
                        Padding="15,5"
                        HorizontalAlignment="Right"
                        Background="#3498db"
                        BorderThickness="0"
                        Content="保存地址"
                        Foreground="White" />
                </Grid>
            </Border>

            <!--  个人信息表单  -->
            <TextBlock
                Margin="0,10"
                FontSize="18"
                FontWeight="Bold"
                Text="5. 个人信息表单" />
            <Border
                Width="500"
                Margin="0,10,0,20"
                Padding="15"
                HorizontalAlignment="Left"
                Background="White"
                BorderBrush="#ddd"
                BorderThickness="1">
                <StackPanel>
                    <Grid>
                        <Grid.RowDefinitions>
                            <RowDefinition Height="Auto" />
                            <RowDefinition Height="Auto" />
                            <RowDefinition Height="Auto" />
                            <RowDefinition Height="Auto" />
                            <RowDefinition Height="Auto" />
                        </Grid.RowDefinitions>
                        <Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                            <ColumnDefinition Width="120" />
                            <ColumnDefinition Width="*" />
                        </Grid.ColumnDefinitions>

                        <TextBlock
                            Grid.Row="0"
                            Grid.Column="0"
                            Margin="0,5"
                            VerticalAlignment="Center"
                            Text="姓名:" />
                        <TextBox
                            Grid.Row="0"
                            Grid.Column="1"
                            Margin="0,5"
                            Padding="5" />

                        <TextBlock
                            Grid.Row="1"
                            Grid.Column="0"
                            Margin="0,5"
                            VerticalAlignment="Center"
                            Text="性别:" />
                        <StackPanel
                            Grid.Row="1"
                            Grid.Column="1"
                            Margin="0,5"
                            Orientation="Horizontal">
                            <RadioButton
                                Margin="0,0,15,0"
                                Content="男"
                                IsChecked="True" />
                            <RadioButton Content="女" />
                        </StackPanel>

                        <TextBlock
                            Grid.Row="2"
                            Grid.Column="0"
                            Margin="0,5"
                            VerticalAlignment="Center"
                            Text="出生日期:" />
                        <DatePicker
                            Grid.Row="2"
                            Grid.Column="1"
                            Margin="0,5" />

                        <TextBlock
                            Grid.Row="3"
                            Grid.Column="0"
                            Margin="0,5"
                            VerticalAlignment="Center"
                            Text="电子邮箱:" />
                        <TextBox
                            Grid.Row="3"
                            Grid.Column="1"
                            Margin="0,5"
                            Padding="5" />

                        <TextBlock
                            Grid.Row="4"
                            Grid.Column="0"
                            Margin="0,5"
                            VerticalAlignment="Top"
                            Text="个人简介:" />
                        <TextBox
                            Grid.Row="4"
                            Grid.Column="1"
                            Height="80"
                            Margin="0,5"
                            Padding="5"
                            AcceptsReturn="True"
                            TextWrapping="Wrap" />
                    </Grid>

                    <StackPanel
                        Margin="0,15,0,0"
                        HorizontalAlignment="Right"
                        Orientation="Horizontal">
                        <Button
                            Margin="0,0,10,0"
                            Padding="15,5"
                            Background="#bdc3c7"
                            BorderThickness="0"
                            Content="取消"
                            Foreground="White" />
                        <Button
                            Padding="15,5"
                            Background="#2ecc71"
                            BorderThickness="0"
                            Content="保存信息"
                            Foreground="White" />
                    </StackPanel>
                </StackPanel>
            </Border>

            <!--  最佳实践说明  -->
            <Border
                Margin="0,10,0,0"
                Padding="15"
                Background="#e8f4f8"
                BorderBrush="#bce8f1"
                BorderThickness="1">
                <StackPanel>
                    <TextBlock FontWeight="Bold" TextWrapping="Wrap">
                        TextBox应用场景最佳实践
                    </TextBlock>
                    <TextBlock Margin="0,10,0,0" TextWrapping="Wrap">
                        1. 始终提供适当的标签，使用户清楚知道应该输入什么<LineBreak />
                        2. 针对不同类型的输入使用不同的TextBox属性设置<LineBreak />
                        3. 对于密码，使用PasswordBox而非TextBox<LineBreak />
                        4. 为长文本输入提供足够的高度和宽度<LineBreak />
                        5. 提供恰当的验证和错误反馈<LineBreak />
                        6. 考虑添加占位符文本，提高用户体验</TextBlock>
                </StackPanel>
            </Border>
        </StackPanel>
    </ScrollViewer>
</Page> 